Five-player quest route. Level band 47-48 is an estimate, not a grind requirement.
next five-friends-43-48/08-maraudon-finish

step Orgrimmar delivery and Mara pickup
  turnin 81 "Ripple Delivery" xp 4400 @59.5,36.6 -- Dran Droffers: Ripple Delivery.
  accept 7068 "Shadowshard Fragments" lvl 39 @39.0,86.1 -- Uthel'nay: Shadowshard Fragments for Maraudon.

step Sen'jin prerequisite
  zone map 1411
  turnin 2935 "Consult Master Gadrin" xp 2900 @55.9,74.7 -- Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village.
  accept 2936 "The Spider God" lvl 40 @55.9,74.7 -- The Spider God: take it before entering Zul'Farrak.

step Skywatcher Plateau dungeon pickups
  zone map 1412
  accept 96775 "Zum'rah's Head" lvl 42 @32.5,20.7 -- Mazu'kon: Zum'rah's Head for Zul'Farrak.
  accept 96776 "An'she's Radiance" lvl 43 @32.6,24.1 -- Olana Brighthoof: An'she's Radiance for Maraudon.

step Gahz'rilla pickup
  zone map 1441
  accept 2770 "Gahz'rilla" lvl 40 @78.1,77.1 -- Wizzle Brassbolts at Mirage Raceway in the Shimmering Flats.

step Prophecy prerequisite hand-in
  zone map 1446
  turnin 3520 "Screecher Spirits" xp 3750 @67.0,22.4 -- Yeh'kinya, Steamwheedle Port.
  accept 3527 "The Prophecy of Mosh'aru" lvl 40 @67.0,22.4 -- The Prophecy of Mosh'aru.

step Gadgetzan dungeon pickups
  accept 2865 "Scarab Shells" lvl 40 @51.6,26.8 -- Tran'rek: Scarab Shells.
  accept 3042 "Troll Temper" lvl 40 @51.4,28.7 -- Trenton Lighthammer: Troll Temper.
  accept 2768 "Divino-matic Rod" lvl 40 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle: Divino-matic Rod.

step Zul'Farrak readiness
  tip Checklist: Scarab Shells, Troll Temper, Divino-matic Rod, Prophecy of Mosh'aru, Gahz'rilla, Tiara of the Deep, Zum'rah's Head, The Spider God. If Tiara is missing, visit Tabetha now. Keep the Maraudon quests in your log.
  task "Every player has all eight ZF quests, and someone carries the Mallet of Zul'Farrak"

step Zul'Farrak: Theka and Zum'rah
  tip Loot the First Mosh'aru Tablet from Theka while here. Collect Troll Temper from the dungeon's trolls throughout the clear. This step is mandatory group content.
  complete 2936 "The Spider God" -- READ the Tablet of Theka in Theka's area for The Spider God; do not confuse it with the prophecy loot.
  complete 96775 "Zum'rah's Head" group 5 -- Kill Witch Doctor Zum'rah and loot his head.

step Zul'Farrak: pyramid and Sergeant Bly
  complete 2768 "Divino-matic Rod" group 5 -- Kill the Executioner, free the prisoners, finish the pyramid event, ask Weegli to open the final gate, then confront and kill Sergeant Bly for the Divino-matic Rod.

step Zul'Farrak: pool, tablets and collections
  tip Check all eight quest objectives before leaving. The one-clear assumption includes finishing these dungeon collections; do not leave while one player still needs loot.
  complete 2846 "Tiara of the Deep" group 5 -- Kill Hydromancer Velratha and loot the Tiara of the Deep.
  complete 3527 "The Prophecy of Mosh'aru" -- Loot both Mosh'aru Tablets: Theka and Hydromancer Velratha.
  complete 2770 "Gahz'rilla" group 5 -- Use the Mallet on the gong, kill Gahz'rilla, and loot the required scale.
  complete 2865 "Scarab Shells" -- Collect five Uncracked Scarab Shells per player.
  complete 3042 "Troll Temper" -- Collect 20 Troll Temper per player.
  task "Finish the full clear, including the final bosses beyond Weegli's opened gate"

step Gadgetzan ZF rewards
  turnin 2865 "Scarab Shells" xp 7800 @51.6,26.8 -- Tran'rek.
  turnin 3042 "Troll Temper" xp 7800 @51.4,28.7 -- Trenton Lighthammer.
  turnin 2768 "Divino-matic Rod" xp 12600 @52.5,28.5 -- Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle.

step Prophecy reward
  tip The Ancient Egg is an optional later chain, not part of this 43-48 budget; it would require returning to Jintha'Alor.
  turnin 3527 "The Prophecy of Mosh'aru" xp 10500 @67.0,22.4 -- Yeh'kinya, Steamwheedle Port.

step Gahz'rilla reward
  zone map 1441
  turnin 2770 "Gahz'rilla" xp 14200 @78.1,77.1 -- Wizzle Brassbolts, Mirage Raceway.

step Tiara reward
  zone map 1445
  turnin 2846 "Tiara of the Deep" xp 12100 @46.0,57.1 -- Tabetha, Dustwallow Marsh.

step Zum'rah reward
  zone map 1412
  tip Keep The Spider God completed in your log for the final Sen'jin delivery. Proceed to Desolace and Maraudon. Keep An'she's Radiance, Shadowshard Fragments and Rot and Regret.
  turnin 96775 "Zum'rah's Head" xp 10100 @32.5,20.7 -- Mazu'kon, Skywatcher Plateau.
